  "instruction": "Claude r17 (2026-09-27): calendar achievement bars and summary page on top of r15 (design ingame/설계_v3_글메뉴판.md, r16 요구 + r17 요구). r17 replaces the r16 candidate, which was never installed; every new function is named KR_T17* (no KR_T16* exists in the runtime). Payload AIN only (PACT/EX untouched). KR_T17* functions appended; no original function relocated; no new same-length swap. Six r15 screen functions keep their index and arguments but their body is now a one-call forwarder at a new address: KR_T9MonthPage -> KR_T17MonthPage (title: 10-cell bar k/n (p%), legend 「▲놓침 ●앞으로 ○다 봄 금색=오늘」, day cells 놓침 ▲ / 앞으로 ● / 다 봄 ○ (no ★); menu rows name k/n + 5-cell bar; 달성도 보기 -> KR_T17SummaryPage, whose dialog top is lowered to y 186 with ■選択ダイアログ／上座標制限値 so the home panel 전체 row stays visible; 3 columns where 2 would exceed 704 px, i.e. September), KR_T9MemPage -> KR_T17MemPage (title 「회상 · 그 밖 (패널 밖)」 + bar line, 113 = all of its own scenes, all outside the panel), KR_T9LaneTitle -> KR_T17LaneTitle (bar line), KR_T9CardRow -> KR_T17CardRow (E-number tail on the 26 rows that collided), KR_T9ChipRow -> KR_T17ChipRow (drawer rows 「이름 k/n □□□□□」), KR_T9MonthChips -> KR_T17MonthChips (이달의 서랍 title counted on the panel set). These screen functions are never on a saved stack. Bars: nearest cell (.5 up), never the last cell before everything is seen. Counts: in months 4-11 every numerator/denominator counts only the home achievement panel set (r9 KR_T8: Σ KR_PlayerEventCount(0..3) / 1043); the 121 calendar events outside it (85 회상 replays, 28 events the game never calls, 8 dungeon-lane events: E00996 E05000 E06001 E10523 E20523 E30523 E40523 E50007) stay listed and playable but are not counted, and appear only in the summary line 「패널 밖 n/121」 and the 회상 · 그 밖 page. The summary first line 「전체 k/1043 (x%)」 prints the panel value with the panel's own KR_T8Pct. r15 rules stay: KR_T9HomeCasual, KR_T9HomeConfig, C_SceneHomebase@CheckGameSysButtons, C_SceneHomebase@Run and LSys3xScript::RunEvent keep index, address and code bytes (r17 verified them byte-identical to the r15 candidate); r15's nine same-length CALLFUNC operands stay applied. Panel code (KR_T8*, KR_Rate*, KR_PlayerEventCount) untouched; the calendar's panel-outside table (KR_T17Out) is derived from KR_PlayerEventCount at build time: if Codex changes the panel set, rebuild the calendar. State lives only in SystemService variables YoruKR.T9.* (never saved); no globals, structs or save schema change. Tables stay r15's (chart/build_chart_v2.py) plus the r16 tail table and the r17 panel-outside table: rebuild when the chart data changes. Every earlier contract stays in force.",
